00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.900
Yeah, sobriety is one of them.

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:48.520
Got it, got it.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:52.720
Okay. You know, you have to beat this game four times to see the actual ending.

