Congratulations, you became a wizard.

00:21:26.180 --> 00:21:27.380
That was the mystery.

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:28.720
That was the great mystery.

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:34.840
Wow. Yeah, I think well is the appropriate stance there.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:37.020
Yeah. Just well.

