Please sing it for me.

00:22:17.960 --> 00:22:27.420
Oh, you know, the game just, it's stuck in my head so much that, no, I don't quite remember it.

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:33.880
But you know what? Speaking of the music, this is one of those games where, like, when it boots up, you're like, oh, no.

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:36.420
Like, there's something about the title theme music.

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:37.500
You're just like, I'm out.

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:41.680
