00:23:42.160 --> 00:23:45.640
Were different enough that he could make these different soundtracks that, like, fit.

00:23:45.820 --> 00:23:48.000
This game all kind of feels the same.

00:23:49.320 --> 00:23:50.600
Yeah, that's right.

00:23:51.080 --> 00:23:52.780
I just figured I'd mention it.

00:23:53.060 --> 00:23:54.080
It's worth mentioning.

00:23:54.220 --> 00:23:55.580
No, we're not yelling at you.

