We're yelling at...

00:23:56.620 --> 00:24:02.060
We're yelling with you. Now, just to go back to the endings for a second, okay?

00:24:02.660 --> 00:24:07.100
I forgot that, like, yes, the fourth one gives you the, quote-unquote, good ending.

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:10.940
But the other times, it, it doesn't matter what you do.

00:24:11.100 --> 00:24:12.580
You could collect every power-up.

00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:14.880
You could never get hurt in the whole game, right?

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:19.840
And you're going to be greeted with, nice try, but not good enough for wizard.

00:24:20.240 --> 00:24:24.400
Try again. Now, that, that makes you think that you missed something, right?

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:26.860
Not that you have to beat the game three more times.

00:24:27.260 --> 00:24:32.280
Yeah, I think that they were, it was just, like, an artificial way of making it seem like you've progressed.

00:24:32.900 --> 00:24:36.900
So, it's like, I, like, people probably wouldn't have known, oh, four times is the magic number.

00:24:37.020 --> 00:24:41.380
They would have just been like, oh, I'm getting better each time, and, like, there must be some, some special thing I have to do.

00:24:41.400 --> 00:24:46.360
And then they get to the end the fourth time, and they're like, oh, finally, like, I finally mastered it.

00:24:46.360 --> 00:24:49.560
Even though, like, there's not, like, a quantifiable thing that they did differently.

00:24:49.980 --> 00:24:58.380
But what they needed to do with this was, like, just to say, like, oh, good, you've collected one of the four philosophical concepts about having a good life.

00:24:58.920 --> 00:25:02.780
Go get the rest of them, and not, like, you did this wrong.

00:25:02.780 --> 00:25:03.760
Now, do it again.

00:25:03.760 --> 00:25:05.760
And so, yeah.

00:25:05.980 --> 00:25:12.740
Now, yeah, the Japanese one, the first time you beat that, it says, congratulations, game end.

00:25:13.080 --> 00:25:14.200
I'm okay with that.

00:25:14.420 --> 00:25:17.080
Like, it's not, it's not much, but it's fine.

00:25:17.240 --> 00:25:26.040
But if you beat it the four times, you actually get this beautiful pixel art of a older wizard giving you, like, the magic scroll.

00:25:26.240 --> 00:25:28.700
And it's really highly detailed.

00:25:28.900 --> 00:25:33.280
And then it says under it, you know, like, one of those motivational poster styles.

00:25:33.280 --> 00:25:35.000
It says, you are great.

00:25:36.840 --> 00:25:40.120
This old man is giving this kid the magic scroll.

