you could put it down.

00:29:40.400 --> 00:29:42.200
I could have. But then, like, I know us.

00:29:42.200 --> 00:29:45.100
I know how we like to, like, take things too far.

00:29:45.140 --> 00:29:47.300
And then it would be like, game of chicken, and everyone would put it on.

00:29:49.720 --> 00:29:52.460
And then we'd go over to your house for Thanksgiving.

00:29:52.700 --> 00:29:53.880
I got it. Yeah.

00:29:55.920 --> 00:29:57.340
Sam, give me your vote.

00:29:58.780 --> 00:30:01.060
Well, this is one of the only games, I think,

00:30:01.120 --> 00:30:03.100
that we've played where when you walk sideways,

00:30:03.100 --> 00:30:04.660
your character's head goes, like,

00:30:04.660 --> 00:30:05.760
back and forth a little bit.

00:30:06.020 --> 00:30:08.400
And you can see, like,

00:30:08.600 --> 00:30:10.640
the eye that's on the other side of their head

00:30:11.180 --> 00:30:13.040
creating, like, a nice little 3D effect.

00:30:14.040 --> 00:30:15.380
And for that reason,

00:30:15.380 --> 00:30:17.100
I'm going to agree with Joe

00:30:17.100 --> 00:30:18.280
and make this game essential.

00:30:19.220 --> 00:30:20.080
Can I change my...

00:30:20.080 --> 00:30:21.920
But he actually didn't make it essential.

00:30:22.220 --> 00:30:23.040
Not in my book.

00:30:24.500 --> 00:30:26.040
No, it's not essential.

00:30:26.280 --> 00:30:27.960
It's just so...

00:30:27.960 --> 00:30:29.420
It's so bland.

00:30:29.960 --> 00:30:31.720
It's... I don't know.

00:30:31.900 --> 00:30:33.820
It's, like, got all the parts of a video game,

00:30:35.420 --> 00:30:37.800
but it's just not really fun to play at all.

00:30:38.100 --> 00:30:40.540
Sean. I agree.

00:30:43.900 --> 00:30:47.180
And I'm also, ladies and gentlemen,

00:30:48.380 --> 00:30:49.580
going to...

00:30:49.580 --> 00:30:51.800
It's Mambo number 5. Vote this.

00:30:52.360 --> 00:30:55.140
Not essential, everyone.

00:30:55.280 --> 00:30:59.100
All right. So, unfortunately, it's my turn to vote,

00:30:59.140 --> 00:31:00.800
and it can't be on the essential games,

00:31:00.800 --> 00:31:02.220
just regardless of what I think.

00:31:02.480 --> 00:31:05.580
But here's what I know about this game.

00:31:05.580 --> 00:31:07.780
It's absolutely a video game,

00:31:08.280 --> 00:31:11.480
and people did have to pay money to play it,

00:31:11.520 --> 00:31:12.440
and that's unfortunate,

00:31:12.440 --> 00:31:13.760
because I'm pretty sure,

00:31:15.020 --> 00:31:16.840
not even, like, 20 years later,

00:31:17.080 --> 00:31:19.740
people would be able to make a video game like this

00:31:20.240 --> 00:31:24.520
on, you know, Game Maker for Windows PC,

00:31:24.660 --> 00:31:25.780
and you could be, like, 8 years old,

00:31:25.820 --> 00:31:27.880
and you could make a game very similar to this.

00:31:29.100 --> 00:31:31.820
You know, that's what we're dealing with here.

00:31:31.900 --> 00:31:33.280
We're dealing with a very...

00:31:33.280 --> 00:31:34.620
We're dealing with one of those games

00:31:34.620 --> 00:31:37.060
that, like, yeah, it works,

00:31:37.080 --> 00:31:38.220
and you could play it,

00:31:38.280 --> 00:31:39.760
but do you want to?

00:31:40.920 --> 00:31:43.620
I think that's where I wound up with this game,

00:31:43.660 --> 00:31:45.720
is that I wasn't even having a hard time

00:31:45.720 --> 00:31:48.380
going through it. It was, do I have the willpower

00:31:48.380 --> 00:31:49.740
to keep playing through?

00:31:50.000 --> 00:31:52.360
The enemies insulted me so much

00:31:52.360 --> 00:31:54.300
that I decided I did not have

00:31:54.300 --> 00:31:55.620
the willpower to keep going.

00:31:55.860 --> 00:31:57.540
I can't believe...

00:31:57.540 --> 00:32:00.720
It's like playing a game of Super Mario Bros.

00:32:00.800 --> 00:32:02.280
where there's just Goombas.

00:32:03.100 --> 00:32:04.920
You know, like, it's unbelievable

00:32:04.920 --> 00:32:06.460
that they went this route,

00:32:06.480 --> 00:32:07.400
and it's unforgivable,

00:32:07.400 --> 00:32:09.280
so it's not going on the essential games list.

00:32:10.260 --> 00:32:11.300
I'd play that game.

00:32:12.480 --> 00:32:15.200
Which one? Super Mario Goomba World.

00:32:15.760 --> 00:32:17.300
I'd play Super Goomba World.

00:32:17.440 --> 00:32:19.880
Yeah. But you'd have to be the Goomba.

00:32:19.900 --> 00:32:21.020
I think we talked about this, right?

00:32:21.020 --> 00:32:22.280
All blocks and all...

00:32:22.280 --> 00:32:24.000
The whole environment is Goomba,

00:32:24.060 --> 00:32:25.420
so you don't know what you can interact...

00:32:25.420 --> 00:32:27.620
Like, everything's just re-skinned.

00:32:28.140 --> 00:32:30.120
So, like, spikes are Goombas,

00:32:30.180 --> 00:32:31.700
but also mushrooms are Goombas.

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:32.900
So you just gotta guess.

